    [$insert("caption"): Template structure gets a real home for exactly as long as the checker needs it, then leaves nothing behind for later stages to misread.]

    [stage:
        [node:
            [$insert("href"): ./]
            [$insert("eyebrow"): Built]
            [$insert("title"): Structure captured as TIR]
            Wrappers, slots, child values, conditional selector/body pairs, loop header/body pairs and placement order stay structured rather than becoming flattened text.
        ]
    ]

    [stage:
        [node:
            [$insert("href"): ./]
            [$insert("eyebrow"): Classified]
            [$insert("title"): prepare_tir_view classifies the value]
            One owner decides whether the whole value is foldable, runtime or a helper, so finalisation never re-litigates it.
        ]

        [$insert("details"):
            [branch:
                [$insert("label"): Two exits]
                [fanout:
                [detail:
                    [$insert("href"): ../html-assembly-and-output/]
                    Static pieces fold to strings with insertion indexes
                ]
